[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあイザナちゃん、私は部室に戻るね。\nレッスン頑張ってね！\u3000応援してる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then, Izana, I'm heading back to the clubroom. Good luck with your lesson! I'm rooting for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう！\u3000レスナちゃんも頑張ってね！\nまた会いに行くね～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks! You do your best too, Resna! I'll come visit again soon!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では改めてイザナ殿！\u3000これから同じユニットの\nメンバーとして、よろしくお願いしまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, Izana! As members of the same unit, I look forward to working with you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナでいいよ！\nこちらこそよろしくね、鬼門！\u3000ヨハナ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just call me Izana! Nice working with you too, Kimon! Johanna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よろしく。\n……ねぇ、社長は？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Likewise. ...Hey, where's the president?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "予定があるらしく、先ほど出て行かれました。\nレッスンを続けていてほしいとのことでございまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She had business to attend to and left a short while ago. She asked that we continue with the lesson."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずは、イザナの歌とダンスを見せてほしいでござる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First, we'd like to see your singing and dancing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、分かった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sure, okay!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――ふぅ。どうだった？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Phew. How was that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "素人同然ね。\n勢いだけでアイドルを始めたのが分かるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Complete amateur. I can tell you jumped into being an idol on pure impulse."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "歌は置いておいても、ダンスはいいと思いまする！\nオリジナルの振り付けにセンスを感じまする……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Setting the singing aside, I thought the dancing was good! Your original choreography shows real flair...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんた、筋肉量と体幹はあるわね。\n何かやってるわけ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've got muscle mass and core strength. Have you been training?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーんと、もしかしたら、\n実家の鍛冶屋のお手伝いで鍛えられているのかも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, maybe? I might've gotten stronger from helping out at my family's smithy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "昔から、重いものを運んだり、\nハンマーを振って遊んだりしてるんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've been hauling heavy stuff around and swinging hammers for fun since I was little!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぶんぶん！\u3000ハンマー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Swing swing! Hammer!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおっ！\u3000これは印象に残るいいアピールですな！\nパフォーマンスに使えそうでございまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh! That's a memorable appeal! It could work great in a performance!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんた、いつもこんなおっきいハンマー\n持ち歩いてるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you always carry around such a huge hammer?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000これの他にも色んなハンマーを持ってるよ！\n気分によって持ち替えてるんだ～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yep! I've got lots of different hammers besides this one! I switch them out depending on my mood!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あ、そう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "戻りましたわ。\nあなたたち！\u3000今から大事な発表をしますわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've returned. Everyone! I have an important announcement to make!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんでございますか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたたちの１ｓｔライブの日程が決まりましたわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The date for your first live performance has been decided!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ラ、ライブ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A l-live performance?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……随分急ね。ま、問題ないけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...That's pretty sudden. Well, not that it's a problem."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "して、日程はいつなのでございますか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When is it scheduled for?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "１ｓｔライブの日程は――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your first live performance will be—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "明日ですわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tomorrow!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、明日ーっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "T-tomorrow?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]